# 0245 = 0244 + forced STOP/re-program watchdogs.  Console showed
#   act==kick (ACTIVE always 1) while 9 GPDs stayed queued: RESUME is a
#   no-op on a pseudo-active queue.  TX forces a STOP+re-program+START
#   every 100 ms while inflight; RX does the same when rxpk is unchanged
#   for 200 ms; otherwise both keep the 20 ms doorbell.
